<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/axios/dist/axios.min.js"></script>
    <script>
        async function getTemWaterQuality(){
            const {data} = await axios.get('/api/tank/lasts');
            const {last,Temstatus} = data
            document.getElementById('min').innerText = `${Temstatus.Mintemperature}도`;
            document.getElementById('max').innerText = `${Temstatus.Maxtemperature}도`
            document.getElementById('temperature').innerText = `${last.temperature}도`;
            document.getElementById('waterquality').innerText = last.water_quality > 255 ? '더러움' : '깨끗함';
            console.log(data);   
        }
        async function feed(){
            const {data}  = await axios.post('/api/tank/feed');
            alert(data);
        }
        getTemWaterQuality();
        setInterval(getTemWaterQuality,5000);
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>탱크 화면입니다.</h1>
    <div>
        실시간 물고기 상태
    </div>
    <div>
        <p>최저온도:<span id="min"></span></p>
        <p>최고온도:<span id="max"></span></p>
        <p>수온:<span id="temperature"></span></p>
        <p>수질:<span id="waterquality"></span></p>
        <button onclick="feed()">먹이주기</button>
        <% if (FeedData.length > 0) { %>
            <% FeedData.forEach(element => { %>
                <p><%= element.feed_time %>  <span><%= element.status ? 'O' : 'X' %></span></p>
            <% }) %>
        <% } else { %>
            <p>먹이 준적이 없습니다.</p>
        <% } %>
        <p>환수하기</p><p>YES</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>